OL,3,GNEWSAPolice stop driver with #1.5m of
OL,4,Acocaine in car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver was found with cocaine with an
OL,7,Festimated street value of more than
OL,8,F#1.5m after being pulled over by
OL,9,Fpolice.
OL,11,FOfficers taking part in an operation by
OL,12,FThames Valley Police's serious and
OL,13,Forganised crime unit stopped Adrian
OL,14,FAdamowicz on Saturday afternoon on the
OL,15,Fsouthbound side of the A34 in Oxford
OL,16,Fand uncovered 21kg (3st 4lbs) of
OL,17,Fcocaine.
OL,19,FAdamowicz, 34, of Tunnel Hill,
OL,20,FWorcester, was arrested and later
OL,21,Fcharged with possession with intent to
OL,22,Fsupply a Class A controlled drug.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
